    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so the turbine side is driven by the exhaust, right? i've noticed that when these things are working hard, they make a really distinct high-pitched whistling or whining sound. is that just physically caused by the air moving through the blades, or is there something else going on with the pressure changes?",
