    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. it's basically just air turbulence then. do you think the sound can change if there's something wrong with the unit, like if there's a tiny bit of debris or if the bearings are starting to go? i've heard some people say it sounds almost like something is alive or howling inside the intake.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
